You are an expert full-stack Next.js, TypeScript, and AI developer.

Tech Stack & Architecture:
- Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui.
- Vercel AI SDK (`ai` and `@ai-sdk/google`) with Zod for structured data output.
- Multi-model modularity: Always import models through `@/lib/ai` so providers can be swapped in one place.
- Data visualization: Recharts for charts, PapaParse for CSV generation, html-to-image for PNG chart exports.

Coding Standards:
- Write clean, type-safe, accessible React client/server components.
- Enforce strict JSON output via `generateObject` and Zod schemas.
- Ensure proper error states, loading skeletons, and fallback handling.
- Never expose or log sensitive API keys on the client side.